.TP
.B invf-mkfs
format a volume
.TP
.B invf-fuse
FUSE daemon (mount)
.TP
.B invf-sweep
offline sweep driver (classification/transcode/seal)
.TP
.B invf-verify
structural + content verification
.TP
.B invf-fsck
check & repair
.TP
.B invf-resize
offline grow/shrink
.TP
.B invf-rollback
undo the last sweep from its savepoint
.TP
.B invf-import
engine-level tree import
.TP
.B invf-stats
statistics walk incl. per-zone ratios
.TP
